vacío</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jedes Mal wenn du die Leere füllst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Toda vez que você preenche o vazio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Каждый раз когда ты заполняешь пустоту</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ogni volta che tu riempi il vuoto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Anata ga kuuhaku o umeru tabi</span></p><p begin="4.390" end="7.280" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4.390" end="4.810">推</span><span begin="4.810" end="5.280">測</span><span begin="5.280" end="5.650">断</span><span begin="5.650" end="5.760">つ</span><span begin="5.760" end="6.000">意</span><span begin="6.000" end="6.230">味</span><span begin="6.230" end="6.420">を</span><span begin="6.420" end="6.890">教</span><span begin="6.890" end="7.130">え</span><span begin="7.130" end="7.280">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请告诉我 斩断猜测的意义</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">請告訴我 斬斷猜測的意義</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Tell me the meaning of severing speculation</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">추측을 끊어내는 의미를 가르쳐 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Apprends-moi le sens de trancher les conjectures</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dime el significado de cortar las sospechas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verrate mir den Sinn Vermutungen zu beenden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ensine-me o significado de cortar as conjecturas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Расскажи мне в чём смысл обрывать догадки</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dimmi il significato di troncare le supposizioni</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Suisoku tatsu imi o oshiete</span></p><p begin="8.210" end="11.530" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="8.210" end="8.950">私</span><span begin="8.950" end="9.200">が</span><span begin="9.340" end="9.830">空</span><span begin="9.830" end="10.290">白</span><span begin="10.290" end="10.560">を</span><span begin="10.560" end="10.730">埋</span><span begin="10.730" end="10.950">め</span><span begin="10.950" end="11.170">る</span><span begin="11.170" end="11.530">度</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我每一次填补空白之时</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我每一次填補空白之時</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Every time I fill in the blanks</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가 공백을 채울 때마다</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Chaque fois que je comble le vide</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cada vez que yo lleno el vacío</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jedes Mal wenn ich die Leere fülle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Toda vez que eu preencho o vazio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Каждый раз когда я заполняю пустоту</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ogni volta che io riempio il vuoto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Watashi ga kuuhaku o umeru tabi</span></p><p begin="11.620" end="14.490" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="11.620" end="12.080">痛</span><span begin="12.080" end="12.530">覚</span><span begin="12.530" end="12.870">立</span><span begin="12.870" end="12.990">つ</span><span begin="12.990" end="13.210">意</span><span begin="13.210" end="13.450">味</span><span begin="13.450" end="13.650">を</span><span begin="13.650" end="14.130">教</span><span begin="14.130" end="14.350">え</span><span begin="14.350" end="14.490">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请告诉我 痛觉苏醒的意义</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">請告訴我 痛覺甦醒的意義</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Tell me the meaning of awakening pain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">통각이 깨어나는 의미를 가르쳐 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Apprends-moi le sens de l&apos;éveil de la douleur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dime el significado de que el dolor despierte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verrate mir den Sinn dass der Schmerz erwacht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ensine-me o significado do sentido da dor despertar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Расскажи мне в чём смысл пробуждения боли</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dimmi il significato del risveglio del dolore</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tsuukaku tatsu imi o oshiete</span></p><p begin="14.960" end="16.140" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.960" end="15.230">い</span><span begin="15.230" end="15.450">い</span><span begin="15.450" end="15.640">で</span><span begin="15.640" end="15.910">す</span><span begin="15.910" end="16.110">か</span><span begin="16.110" end="16.140">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可以吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">可以嗎？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Is it alright?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">괜찮을까?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Est-ce permis ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Te parece bien?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ist es in Ordnung?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tudo bem?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Можно ли?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Va bene?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ii desu ka?</span></p><p begin="29.870" end="33.170" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.870" end="30.130">あ</span><span begin="30.130" end="30.340">な</span><span begin="30.340" end="30.560">た</span><span begin="30.560" end="30.770">が</span><span begin="30.990" end="31.430">空</span><span begin="31.430" end="31.940">白</span><span begin="31.940" end="32.180">を</span><span begin="32.180" end="32.380">埋</span><span begin="32.380" end="32.620">め</span><span begin